  "prompt": "Which competitor checked each product most recently, and how many products is that per competitor? observed_ts holds UTC time. Each product with a competitor check counts once, under the competitor of its check with the latest observed_ts. When two checks of a product tie on observed_ts, the one whose competitor comes first alphabetically is kept. Return two columns, in this order: competitor and products. Return one row for each competitor with some product's latest check. Any row order is fine.",
